# Enterprise Intelligence System

A production-oriented enterprise intelligence platform for centralizing data, metrics, forecasts, governance, and executive visibility.

## Highlights

- Multi-source data ingestion foundation
- KPI, risk, and forecast APIs
- Executive dashboard UI
- Governance and access controls
- Observability and deployment automation

## Architecture

```text
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                           Presentation Layer                          │
│  React dashboard + role-aware views + operational drill-downs       │
└───────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                                │
┌───────────────────────────────▼─────────────────────────────────────┐
│                            Application Layer                           │
│  FastAPI routers: dashboards, analytics, governance, auth, sources  │
└───────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                                │
┌───────────────────────────────▼─────────────────────────────────────┐
│                            Intelligence Layer                           │
│  KPI aggregation, anomaly detection, risk scoring, forecasting       │
└───────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                                │
┌───────────────────────────────▼─────────────────────────────────────┐
│                             Data Layer                                 │
│  PostgreSQL + Redis + ingestion connectors + warehouse-ready models │
└───────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                                │
┌───────────────────────────────▼─────────────────────────────────────┐
│                           Governance Layer                            │
│  RBAC, audit trails, retention, security posture, compliance        │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## Quick start

### Docker Compose

```bash
docker compose up --build
```

Access:

- Frontend: http://localhost:5173
- Backend API: http://localhost:8000/docs

### Local backend

```bash
cd backend
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

### Local frontend

```bash
cd web
npm install
npm run dev -- --host 0.0.0.0
```

